## About this record
{% if self_contained %}

This is a **self-contained** Zenodo record for a [Camtrap DP](https://camtrap-dp.tdwg.org/)
camera-trap dataset: `{{ zip_filename }}` bundles `datapackage.json`, `deployments.csv`,
`media.csv` (with `filePath` relative to `images/`), `observations.csv`, and the `images/`
folder itself — everything needed to use the dataset offline, in a single archive. The loose
CSVs and images are not published separately; only `{{ zip_filename }}` (plus this README,
license and citation) makes up the record.

```text
.
├── {{ zip_filename }}          ← self-contained package: datapackage.json + CSVs + images/, filePath relative
├── checksums-sha256.txt
├── CITATION.cff
└── LICENSE
```
{% else %}

This is a **metadata-only** Zenodo record for a [Camtrap DP](https://camtrap-dp.tdwg.org/) camera-trap
dataset — it does not host the images. The full dataset (including public images) is
published on HuggingFace Hub; this record exists to give the dataset a permanent,
citable DOI.

```text
.
├── datapackage.json      ← Camtrap DP metadata descriptor
├── deployments.csv       ← camera deployment records
├── media.csv             ← media (image) records — public media only, filePath points to HuggingFace Hub
├── observations.csv      ← classification/observation records
├── checksums-sha256.txt
├── CITATION.cff
└── LICENSE
```

